    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "我们知道，如果两个三角形的两边和它们的夹角分别相等，那么这两个三角形全等.如果两个三角形的两边和其中一边的对角分别相等，那么这两个三角形全等吗？"
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        103,
        104,
        847,
        182
      ],
      "reading_order": 4,
      "original_image_bbox": [
        223,
        319,
        1841,
        558
      ],
      "model_image_bbox": [
        116,
        166,
        958,
        291
      ],
      "pdf_page_bbox": [
        53.72,
        76.64,
        441.75,
        134.13
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": {
        "paragraph_content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "如图14.2-5， "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A B C"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "与 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A B D"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "满足两边和其中一边的对角分别相等，即 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A B = A B"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "A C = A D"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": ", "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\angle B = \\angle B"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": ",但 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A B C"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "与 "
          },
          {
            "type": "equation_inline",
            "content": "\\triangle A B D"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "content": "显然不全等．这说明，两边和其中一边的对角分别相等的两个三角形不一定全等."
          }
        ]
      },
      "bbox": [
        81,
